  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes quantum algorithms for online learning and generalized linear models based on the Hedge algorithm. It shows theoretical runtime improvements from O(TN) classical complexity to roughly eO(T^2√N/ε) for loss estimation and eO(λ^6√N ε^{-7}) for the Quantum Sparsitron, yielding polynomial speedups in the feature dimension N. These results are purely analytical and assume oracle or QRAM access to data.",
